### 検証プレビュー（既定値）
POST http://localhost:8083/api/imports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contacts.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./contacts.csv
--sample--

### 実際の登録
POST http://localhost:8083/api/imports?dryRun=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contacts.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./contacts.csv
--sample--

### 連絡先一覧の取得
GET http://localhost:8083/api/contacts
